## FINAL MUST-PASS CHECKLIST

- [ ] Recency uses effective dates; quality gates prevent “fresh junk”
- [ ] Every executive bullet tagged fact/inference/hypothesis with evidence or caveat
- [ ] Economics section has evidence or explicit “unknown”
- [ ] People list justified by goal-linked influence signals; no doxxing
- [ ] Social section uses public permalinks; excerpts short; recommendations ethical
- [ ] Limitations section lists coverage gaps
- [ ] Final text passes verification discipline (`rule.general.verify-info.v1`)
- [ ] Pack layout matches `templar.market-research.deepsearch-pack.v1`
